  <Document id="10W6vqWzRr26F62GAX4J5uZrJkmtmK8Lt">
    <name>Some Coords Related</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Uma coleção de coordenadas encontradas no post a seguir: https://www.reddit.com/r/ChantillyGenericEvent/comments/x7xiuq/cassini_diskus/

Caso o post seja excluído, aqui está ele:

"Cassini Diskus
39.7808257,59.1359297 (Turkmenistan)

Cassini Diskus 48.440355, -47.724230

Cassini Diskus - 21.760579, 39.329420

Cassini Diskus - 72.267445, 15.125097

Cassini Diskus - Site -31.321476, 175.000325

Cassini Diskus - Entry Event 38°40'52.2"N 69°27'45.0"E

Cassini Diskus - Entry Event 45°54'29.5"N+103°37'00.2"E

Cassini Diskus +40.121463, -112.915551

Cassini Diskus - Entry Event 45.886327, 87.361847

Cassini Diskus - 48.261512, 71.999473

Cassini Diskus - +17.595563, +27.419459

Cassini Diskus - 33.552608, -100.517892

Cassini Diskus –74° 45′ 10.9583″

Cassini Diskus - -25.292531, 130.749575

Cassini Diskus - +35.760190, -82.442803

Cassini Diskus - +39.285286, -103.787314

Cassini Diskus - +52.935655, -34.822339

Cassini Diskus - +52.936358, -34.826280

Cassini Diskus - "Sienna" last seen at 28.137725, 61.008806

Cassini Diskus - "Sienna" 34.347303, 57.206411

Cassini Diskus - +11.563285, +92.236034

Cassini Diskus - 72.627°N 3.951°E (Entry Event)

Cassini Diskus - +9.446663, +94.344333

Cassini Diskus +21.128135, -11.403915

Cassini Diskus - +38.639132, -102.849702

Cassini Diskus - +39.749555, +82.780638

Cassini Diskus - -13.162543, -18.435815

Cassini Diskus - -16.506432, -14.081690

Cassini Diskus - 33.853806, 36.440693 (Jabrud - calibration)

Cassini Diskus - -36.486425, -16.934297

Cassini Diskus +41.642213, -116.969045

Cassini Diskus - "Sienna" -37.231200, -13.142772

Cassini Diskus +16.658584, -116.689209

Cassini Diskus +18.256028, -81.699944

Cassini Diskus +32.046861, -105.682840

Cassini Diskus: 18.178°S 178.111°W (Mission Wrap-up)

Cassini Diskus: 35.526537, 64.605441

Cassini Diskus: +40.279489, +103.571701

Cassini Diskus - AfC Recovery Point 67.512206, 48.776419

Cassini Diskus - "Presence" (ISR over +32.649542, +79.677849)

Cassini Diskus - S17E 67.511209, 48.782778"]]></description>
